      "message": "[warning] Line 95: 🟡 Applying `.accessibilityValue(action.accessibilityValue ?? \"\")` sets an explicit empty value on every control, not just the audio-output button. For VoiceOver this can override default value/state announcements and may produce a degraded experience. Set the modifier conditionally only when `action.accessibilityValue` is non-nil (or provide per-intent values) so unaffected buttons keep their native accessibility behavior.",
